summary:
  A tip of the face is again a window placed by a position the window does not have.

history:
  PlasmaCore.ToolTipArea places its tip by the item's position inside its
  window, read as a place on the screen. In the player's own window the
  Stop button at (800, 686) got its tip at (162, 473). The face's tips are
  drawn inside the window the face sits in.

target:
  package/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml

find:
                          PlasmaComponents3.ToolTip { text: i18n("Playback speed — tap to change") }

replace:
                          PlasmaCore.ToolTipArea { anchors.fill: parent; mainText: i18n("Playback speed — tap to change") }

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_invariants.py::test_the_faces_tooltips_are_drawn_in_the_window_the_face_is_in.
  Line-neutral.
